Title: Collaborative cancellation for coroutines
Shortname: Pxxxx
Revision: 0
Status: P
Date: 2026-08-16
Group: WG21
Audience: EWG, LEWG
Editor: Bizwen Zhang<zhangbizwen@example.com>, zhangbizwen@example.com
